{{-- Terms and conditions shown on the sign-up page. Edit the text here. --}}
<ol>
    <li><b>Reservations.</b> A reservation is a request until reception or the admin has checked your uploaded ID and approved it. You are told when it is confirmed or declined.</li>
    <li><b>Valid ID.</b> Every guest must present a valid ID at check-in. The ID is kept at reception during the stay and returned at check-out.</li>
    <li><b>Check-in and check-out.</b> Please arrive and leave at the times on your reservation. Staying longer may add charges.</li>
    <li><b>Payment.</b> The bill is settled at reception at check-out, based on the room rate and length of stay, plus any extra services or damages.</li>
    <li><b>Cancellation.</b> You can cancel a reservation from "My reservations" any time before check-in.</li>
    <li><b>Care of the room.</b> Rooms are inspected at check-out. Guests are responsible for damage or missing items.</li>
    <li><b>House rules.</b> Follow the safety and security rules of the compound. Only registered guests may stay in the room.</li>
    <li><b>Your information.</b> Your name, email and contact number are used only to manage your reservation and stay.</li>
</ol>
